  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of workers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Liberia Labour Congress (LLC) is the critical voice of workers as well as a key social partner to represent the positions of workers to ensure effective labour market governance in Liberia, however the recent leadership being experienced by the Congress has constantly reduced its capacity to effectively represent its members. The ILO has been supporting different capacity building initiatives to improve and strengthen the capacity of the Congress.
This intervention focuses on strengthening the capacity of the congress to engage in social dialogue and quality representation for its members.</narrative>
  </description>
